# Authentication with Role-Based Access

Implement a complete auth system (login, register, role-based routing) using Supabase Auth + Prisma, following the FocusForge UI/UX guidelines and Clean Architecture patterns.

## Current State

All files in the project are empty scaffolds. The Prisma schema is complete and defines `User` with a `Role` enum (`STUDENT`, `TEACHER`, `ADMIN`). Supabase is configured in `.env`. No code exists yet in any `.ts`/`.tsx` file.

