### Server Actions (lib/actions/)

#### [MODIFY] [auth.actions.ts](file:///c:/Users/Administrator/Desktop/FocusForge/CODEKADA/lib/actions/auth.actions.ts)
- `signUp(formData)` — Validates with Zod, calls `supabase.auth.signUp()`, creates a matching Prisma `User` record with the selected role, redirects to the appropriate dashboard.
- `signIn(formData)` — Validates with Zod, calls `supabase.auth.signInWithPassword()`, looks up Prisma role, redirects to the correct dashboard (`/dashboard` for students, `/dashboard` for teachers — same path, different route groups handle it via middleware).
- `signOut()` — Calls `supabase.auth.signOut()`, redirects to `/login`.

